<style>
  /* Página encerrada usa o body GLOBAL (já com a floresta única fixa do styles.css).
     Aqui só aplica o gradiente-tint sobreposto, igual todas as outras seções. */
  :root {
    --tint-section:
      linear-gradient(rgba(2, 73, 2, 0.86), rgb(47 18 0 / 86%));
  }

  .closed-page {
    min-height: 85vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    /* SÓ o gradiente. Floresta = body. */
    background-image: var(--tint-section);
  }

  /* Efeito de fundo sutil */
  .closed-page::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.08) 0%, rgba(11, 32, 64, 0) 70%);
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .closed-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    /* border-top removida conforme pedido */
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    max-width: 500px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .icon-wrapper {
    width: 90px;
    height: 90px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2), rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.05));
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    color: #ffd700;
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .closed-title {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .closed-desc {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .highlight-date {
    color: #ffd700;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .btn-home {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #ffd700;
    color: #0b2040;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    border-radius: 50px; /* Botão arredondado */
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .btn-home:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
    background: #ffea00;
  }
  
  .btn-home svg {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .btn-home:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  .footer-note {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }
</style>

<div class="closed-page">
  <div class="closed-card">
    <!-- Ícone Animado -->
    <div class="icon-wrapper">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
        <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
        <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
        <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
        <path d="M8 14h.01"></path>
        <path d="M12 14h.01"></path>
        <path d="M16 14h.01"></path>
        <path d="M8 18h.01"></path>
        <path d="M12 18h.01"></path>
        <path d="M16 18h.01"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <h1 class="closed-title">Inscrições<br>Encerradas</h1>
    
    {{#if limitAtletas}}
      <p class="closed-desc">
        O limite de <span class="highlight-date">300 ciclistas (atletas)</span> já foi atingido.
        <br><br>
        Não é mais possível fazer novas inscrições ou concluir pagamentos pendentes para atletas.
        As inscrições de acompanhantes continuam disponíveis normalmente.
      </p>
    {{else}}
      <p class="closed-desc">
        O período de inscrições para a Trilha do Buriti chegou ao fim no dia <span class="highlight-date">22 de novembro</span>.
        <br><br>
        Agradecemos a todos que garantiram sua vaga!
      </p>
    {{/if}}

    <a href="/" class="btn-home">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
      </svg>
      Voltar ao Início
    </a>

    <div class="footer-note">
      Dúvidas? Entre em contato com a organização.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
